difficult for low income individuals and families to purchase a home and any
assistance that they can receive is welcome.  Also acquiring housing for the
homeless and other special populations is a need.  Having a more stable housing
situation, other than a shelter, will help end homelessness.  Even though the
above activities have a low priority they are still needs in Cheyenne.
