by the City's Finance Department.  Each month expenses are drawn down utilizing IDIS, as well as to
report program performance.  Cheyenne's CDBG program manager regularly monitors all CDBG projects
for regulatory compliance.  Monitoring occurs in many different forms to include desk monitoring,
phone and e-mail monitoring, and on site visits, which are outlined in the Sub Grantee Procedures.
